    questionText: "(i) Explain, in detail, the sequence of operation of the circuit as the temperature changes. (ii) Redraw the circuit to include a 12V fan which switches on above a set threshold temperature. (iii) Explain each of the following terms: • Astable configuration • Monostable configuration.",
