    section: "C", questionRef: "2011 HL Section C Q5(a)(i), (ii)",
    questionText: "(i) Outline the main environmental consequences of each of the following: • promoting the use of softwoods rather than hardwoods for classroom furniture • using thermosetting plastics. Use specific examples to support your answer. (ii) Describe a method of testing samples of ash, brass and polystyrene foam for thermal insulation properties.",
