    stem: "The casing for a computer mouse is shown. The casing can be made from either aluminium or plastic.",
    questionText: "(i) Select a suitable plastic material for the casing and justify your selection. (ii) Describe, using annotated sketches, how the casing might be commercially manufactured. (iii) Explain, in detail, how the top and bottom parts of the mouse could be joined together while allowing for occasional disassembly to facilitate cleaning and maintenance.",
