          "alt": "The marking scheme's own answers for 2012 HL Section C 4(b), as the State Examinations Commission printed them: (i) A: Cp = Tolerance Range over 6 sigma = (25.02 - 24.95) over 6(0.0103) = 1.13; B: (25.02 - 24.95) over 6(0.0123) = 0.95, as stacked fractions; and (iii) the two graphs, the wide curve 1 captioned Manufacturer B and the narrow curve 2 captioned Manufacturer A.",
