    section: "C", questionRef: "2020 HL Section C Q4(c)(i)",
    questionText: "A core principle of lean manufacturing methodology is the removal of waste within an operation. Describe, with reference to a specific example, each of the following potential sources of waste in a manufacturing context: • Defects • Time • Production • Stock.",
